"id": 42, "seek": 14714, "start": 147.14, "end": 148.64, "text": " the Gentiles will hope.", "tokens": [50365, 264, 33070, 4680, 486, 1454, 13, 50440], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.29345474924360004, "compression_ratio": 1.588235294117647, "no_speech_prob": 0.0020147929899394512}, {"id": 43, "seek": 14714, "start": 149.29999999999998, "end": 153.67999999999998, "text": " Then a demon-oppressed man who was blind and mute was brought to him,", "tokens": [50473, 1396, 257, 14283, 12, 17158, 3805, 587, 567, 390, 6865, 293, 24523, 390, 3038, 281, 796, 11, 50692], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.29345474924360004, "compression_ratio": 1.588235294117647, "no_speech_prob": 0.0020147929899394512}, {"id": 44, "seek": 14714, "start": 153.83999999999997, "end": 156.98, "text": " and he healed him, so that the man spoke and saw.", "tokens": [50700, 293, 415, 20482, 796, 11, 370, 300, 264, 587, 7179, 293, 1866, 13, 50857], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.29345474924360004, "compression_ratio": 1.588235294117647, "no_speech_prob": 0.0020147929899394512}, {"id": 45, "seek": 14714, "start": 157.55999999999997, "end": 160.26, "text": " And all the people were amazed and said,", "tokens": [50886, 400, 439, 264, 561, 645, 20507, 293, 848, 11, 51021], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.29345474924360004, "compression_ratio": 1.588235294117647, "no_speech_prob": 0.0020147929899394512}, {"id": 46, "seek": 14714, "start": 160.89999999999998, "end": 162.51999999999998, "text": " Can this be the son of David?", "tokens": [51053, 1664, 341, 312, 264, 1872, 295, 4389, 30, 51134], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.29345474924360004, "compression_ratio": 1.588235294117647, "no_speech_prob": 0.0020147929899394512}, {"id": 47, "seek": 14714, "start": 163.22, "end": 166.01999999999998, "text": " But when the Pharisees heard it, they said,", "tokens": [51169, 583, 562, 264, 47742, 279, 2198, 309, 11, 436, 848, 11, 51309], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.29345474924360004, "compression_ratio": 1.588235294117647, "no_speech_prob": 0.0020147929899394512}, {"id": 48, "seek": 14714, "start": 166.72, "end": 172.14, "text": " It is only by Beelzebul, the prince of demons, that this man casts out demons.", "tokens": [51344, 467, 307, 787, 538, 879, 338, 1381, 12176, 11, 264, 16467, 295, 19733, 11, 300, 341, 587, 41921, 484, 19733, 13, 51615], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.29345474924360004, "compression_ratio": 1.588235294117647, "no_speech_prob": 0.0020147929899394512}, {"id": 49, "seek": 14714, "start": 172.79999999999998, "end": 176.14, "text": " Knowing their thoughts, he said to them,", "tokens": [51648, 25499, 641, 4598, 11, 415, 848, 281, 552, 11, 51815], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.29345474924360004, "compression_ratio": 1.588235294117647, "no_speech_prob": 0.0020147929899394512}, {"id": 50, "seek": 17614, "start": 176.14, "end": 179.79999999999998, "text": " Every kingdom divided against itself is laid waste,", "tokens": [50365, 2048, 10231, 6666, 1970, 2564, 307, 9897, 5964, 11, 50548], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17577225821358816, "compression_ratio": 1.7956521739130435, "no_speech_prob": 0.04315657913684845}, {"id": 51, "seek": 17614, "start": 180.29999999999998, "end": 183.33999999999997, "text": " and no city or house divided against itself will stand.", "tokens": [50573, 293, 572, 2307, 420, 1782, 6666, 1970, 2564, 486, 1463, 13, 50725], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17577225821358816, "compression_ratio": 1.7956521739130435, "no_speech_prob": 0.04315657913684845}, {"id": 52, "seek": 17614, "start": 184.04, "end": 188.27999999999997, "text": " And if Satan casts out Satan, he is divided against himself.", "tokens": [50760, 400, 498, 16583, 41921, 484, 16583, 11, 415, 307, 6666, 1970, 3647, 13, 50972], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17577225821358816, "compression_ratio": 1.7956521739130435, "no_speech_prob": 0.04315657913684845}, {"id": 53, "seek": 17614, "start": 188.92, "end": 190.82, "text": " How then will his kingdom stand?", "tokens": [51004, 1012, 550, 486, 702, 10231, 1463, 30, 51099], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17577225821358816, "compression_ratio": 1.7956521739130435, "no_speech_prob": 0.04315657913684845}, {"id": 54, "seek": 17614, "start": 191.42, "end": 193.85999999999999, "text": " And if I cast out demons by Beelzebul,", "tokens": [51129, 400, 498, 286, 4193, 484, 19733, 538, 879, 338, 1381, 12176, 11, 51251], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17577225821358816, "compression_ratio": 1.7956521739130435, "no_speech_prob": 0.04315657913684845}, {"id": 55, "seek": 17614, "start": 194.22, "end": 196.56, "text": " by whom do your sons cast them out?", "tokens": [51269, 538, 7101, 360, 428, 13476, 4193, 552, 484, 30, 51386], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17577225821358816, "compression_ratio": 1.7956521739130435, "no_speech_prob": 0.04315657913684845}, {"id": 56, "seek": 17614, "start": 197.06, "end": 198.98, "text": " Therefore they will be your judges.", "tokens": [51411, 7504, 436, 486, 312, 428, 14449, 13, 51507], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17577225821358816, "compression_ratio": 1.7956521739130435, "no_speech_prob": 0.04315657913684845}, {"id": 57, "seek": 17614, "start": 199.7, "end": 202.61999999999998, "text": " But if it is by the Spirit of God that I cast out demons,", "tokens": [51543, 583, 498, 309, 307, 538, 264, 7218, 295, 1265, 300, 286, 4193, 484, 19733, 11, 51689], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17577225821358816, "compression_ratio": 1.7956521739130435, "no_speech_prob": 0.04315657913684845}, {"id": 58, "seek": 17614, "start": 202.61999999999998, "end": 205.92, "text": " then the kingdom of God has come upon you.", "tokens": [51689, 550, 264, 10231, 295, 1265, 575, 808, 3564, 291, 13, 51854], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17577225821358816, "compression_ratio": 1.7956521739130435, "no_speech_prob": 0.04315657913684845}, {"id": 59, "seek": 20614, "start": 206.14, "end": 210.94, "text": " Or how can someone enter a strong man's house and plunder his goods,", "tokens": [50365, 1610, 577, 393, 1580, 3242, 257, 2068, 587, 311, 1782, 293, 499, 6617, 702, 10179, 11, 50605], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16957207648984848, "compression_ratio": 1.876, "no_speech_prob": 0.08505642414093018}, {"id": 60, "seek": 20614, "start": 211.39999999999998, "end": 213.5, "text": " unless he first binds the strong man?", "tokens": [50628, 5969, 415, 700, 41515, 264, 2068, 587, 30, 50733], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16957207648984848, "compression_ratio": 1.876, "no_speech_prob": 0.08505642414093018}, {"id": 61, "seek": 20614, "start": 213.89999999999998, "end": 216.05999999999997, "text": " Then indeed he may plunder his house.", "tokens": [50753, 1396, 6451, 415, 815, 499, 6617, 702, 1782, 13, 50861], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16957207648984848, "compression_ratio": 1.876, "no_speech_prob": 0.08505642414093018}, {"id": 62, "seek": 20614, "start": 216.82, "end": 219.27999999999997, "text": " Whoever is not with me is against me,", "tokens": [50899, 24743, 307, 406, 365, 385, 307, 1970, 385, 11, 51022], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16957207648984848, "compression_ratio": 1.876, "no_speech_prob": 0.08505642414093018}, {"id": 63, "seek": 20614, "start": 219.42, "end": 222.0, "text": " and whoever does not gather with me scatters.", "tokens": [51029, 293, 11387, 775, 406, 5448, 365, 385, 34951, 82, 13, 51158], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16957207648984848, "compression_ratio": 1.876, "no_speech_prob": 0.08505642414093018}, {"id": 64, "seek": 20614, "start": 222.57999999999998, "end": 223.6, "text": " Therefore I tell you,", "tokens": [51187, 7504, 286, 980, 291, 11, 51238], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16957207648984848, "compression_ratio": 1.876, "no_speech_prob": 0.08505642414093018}, {"id": 65, "seek": 20614, "start": 224.01999999999998, "end": 226.66, "text": " every sin and blasphemy will be forgiven people,", "tokens": [51259, 633, 3343, 293, 46409, 950, 3633, 486, 312, 30391, 561, 11, 51391], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16957207648984848, "compression_ratio": 1.876, "no_speech_prob": 0.08505642414093018}, {"id": 66, "seek": 20614, "start": 227.0, "end": 230.1, "text": " but the blasphemy against the Spirit will not be forgiven.", "tokens": [51408, 457, 264, 46409, 950, 3633, 1970, 264, 7218, 486, 406, 312, 30391, 13, 51563], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16957207648984848, "compression_ratio": 1.876, "no_speech_prob": 0.08505642414093018}, {"id": 67, "seek": 20614, "start": 230.1, "end": 234.01999999999998, "text": " And whoever speaks a word against the Son of Man will be forgiven,", "tokens": [51563, 400, 11387, 10789, 257, 1349, 1970, 264, 5185, 295, 2458, 486, 312, 30391, 11, 51759], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16957207648984848, "compression_ratio": 1.876, "no_speech_prob": 0.08505642414093018}, {"id": 68, "seek": 20614, "start": 234.66, "end": 236.11999999999998, "text": " but whoever speaks against the Holy Spirit,", "tokens": [51791, 457, 11387, 10789, 1970, 264, 6295, 7218, 11, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16957207648984848, "compression_ratio": 1.876, "no_speech_prob": 0.08505642414093018}, {"id": 69, "seek": 23614, "start": 236.14, "end": 238.14, "text": " will not be forgiven,", "tokens": [50365, 486, 406, 312, 30391, 11, 50465], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21604521134320429, "compression_ratio": 2.2990654205607477, "no_speech_prob": 0.01936727948486805}, {"id": 70, "seek": 23614, "start": 238.14, "end": 241.14, "text": " either in this age or in the age to come.", "tokens": [50465, 2139, 294, 341, 3205, 420, 294, 264, 3205, 281, 808, 13, 50615], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21604521134320429, "compression_ratio": 2.2990654205607477, "no_speech_prob": 0.01936727948486805}, {"id": 71, "seek": 23614, "start": 243.14, "end": 246.14, "text": " Either make the tree good and its fruit good,", "tokens": [50715, 13746, 652, 264, 4230, 665, 293, 1080, 6773, 665, 11, 50865], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21604521134320429, "compression_ratio": 2.2990654205607477, "no_speech_prob": 0.01936727948486805}, {"id": 72, "seek": 23614, "start": 246.14, "end": 248.14, "text": " or make the tree bad and its fruit bad,", "tokens": [50865, 420, 652, 264, 4230, 1578, 293, 1080, 6773, 1578, 11, 50965], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21604521134320429, "compression_ratio": 2.2990654205607477, "no_speech_prob": 0.01936727948486805}, {"id": 73, "seek": 23614, "start": 248.14, "end": 251.14, "text": " for the tree is known by its fruit.", "tokens": [50965, 337, 264, 4230, 307, 2570, 538, 1080, 6773, 13, 51115], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21604521134320429, "compression_ratio": 2.2990654205607477, "no_speech_prob": 0.01936727948486805}, {"id": 74, "seek": 23614, "start": 251.14, "end": 253.14, "text": " You brood of vipers,", "tokens": [51115, 509, 2006, 378, 295, 371, 647, 433, 11, 51215], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21604521134320429, "compression_ratio": 2.2990654205607477, "no_speech_prob": 0.01936727948486805}, {"id": 75, "seek": 23614, "start": 253.14, "end": 256.14, "text": " how can you speak good when you are evil?", "tokens": [51215, 577, 393, 291, 1710, 665, 562, 291, 366, 6724, 30, 51365], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21604521134320429, "compression_ratio": 2.2990654205607477, "no_speech_prob": 0.01936727948486805}, {"id": 76, "seek": 23614, "start": 256.14, "end": 260.14, "text": " For out of the abundance of the heart the mouth speaks.", "tokens": [51365, 1171, 484, 295, 264, 23391, 295, 264, 1917, 264, 4525, 10789, 13, 51565], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21604521134320429, "compression_ratio": 2.2990654205607477, "no_speech_prob": 0.01936727948486805}, {"id": 77, "seek": 23614, "start": 261.14, "end": 264.14, "text": " The good person out of his good treasure brings forth good,", "tokens": [51615, 440, 665, 954, 484, 295, 702, 665, 12985, 5607, 5220, 665, 11, 51765], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21604521134320429, "compression_ratio": 2.2990654205607477, "no_speech_prob": 0.01936727948486805}, {"id": 78, "seek": 23614, "start": 264.14, "end": 265.14, "text": " and the evil person out of his good treasure brings forth good,", "tokens": [51765, 293, 264, 6724, 954, 484, 295, 702, 665, 12985, 5607, 5220, 665, 11, 51815], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21604521134320429, "compression_ratio": 2.2990654205607477, "no_speech_prob": 0.01936727948486805}, {"id": 79, "seek": 23614, "start": 265.14, "end": 266.14, "text": " and the evil person out of his good treasure brings forth good,", "tokens": [51815, 293, 264, 6724, 954, 484, 295, 702, 665, 12985, 5607, 5220, 665, 11, 51865], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21604521134320429, "compression_ratio": 2.2990654205607477, "no_speech_prob": 0.01936727948486805}, {"id": 80, "seek": 26614, "start": 266.14, "end": 269.14, "text": " and the evil person out of his evil treasure brings forth evil.", "tokens": [50365, 293, 264, 6724, 954, 484, 295, 702, 6724, 12985, 5607, 5220, 6724, 13, 50515], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09358063237420444, "compression_ratio": 1.6653386454183268, "no_speech_prob": 0.004674032796174288}, {"id": 81, "seek": 26614, "start": 269.14, "end": 270.14, "text": " I tell you,", "tokens": [50515, 286, 980, 291, 11, 50565], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09358063237420444, "compression_ratio": 1.6653386454183268, "no_speech_prob": 0.004674032796174288}, {"id": 82, "seek": 26614, "start": 270.14, "end": 272.14, "text": " on the day of judgment,", "tokens": [50565, 322, 264, 786, 295, 12216, 11, 50665], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09358063237420444, "compression_ratio": 1.6653386454183268, "no_speech_prob": 0.004674032796174288}, {"id": 83, "seek": 26614, "start": 272.14, "end": 276.14, "text": " people will give account for every careless word they speak.", "tokens": [50665, 561, 486, 976, 2696, 337, 633, 46187, 1349, 436, 1710, 13, 50865], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09358063237420444, "compression_ratio": 1.6653386454183268, "no_speech_prob": 0.004674032796174288}, {"id": 84, "seek": 26614, "start": 276.14, "end": 279.14, "text": " For by your words you will be justified,", "tokens": [50865, 1171, 538, 428, 2283, 291, 486, 312, 27808, 11, 51015], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09358063237420444, "compression_ratio": 1.6653386454183268, "no_speech_prob": 0.004674032796174288}, {"id": 85, "seek": 26614, "start": 279.14, "end": 282.14, "text": " and by your words you will be condemned.", "tokens": [51015, 293, 538, 428, 2283, 291, 486, 312, 36472, 13, 51165], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09358063237420444, "compression_ratio": 1.6653386454183268, "no_speech_prob": 0.004674032796174288}, {"id": 86, "seek": 26614, "start": 282.14, "end": 286.14, "text": " Then some of the scribes and Pharisees answered him, saying,", "tokens": [51165, 1396, 512, 295, 264, 39435, 279, 293, 47742, 279, 10103, 796, 11, 1566, 11, 51365], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09358063237420444, "compression_ratio": 1.6653386454183268, "no_speech_prob": 0.004674032796174288}, {"id": 87, "seek": 26614, "start": 286.14, "end": 289.14, "text": " Teacher, we wish to see a sign from you.", "tokens": [51365, 19745, 11, 321, 3172, 281, 536, 257, 1465, 490, 291, 13, 51515], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09358063237420444, "compression_ratio": 1.6653386454183268, "no_speech_prob": 0.004674032796174288}, {"id": 88, "seek": 26614, "start": 289.14, "end": 292.14, "text": " But he answered them,", "tokens": [51515, 583, 415, 10103, 552, 11, 51665], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09358063237420444, "compression_ratio": 1.6653386454183268, "no_speech_prob": 0.004674032796174288}, {"id": 89, "seek": 26614, "start": 292.14, "end": 295.14, "text": " An evil and adulterous generation seeks for a sign,", "tokens": [51665, 1107, 6724, 293, 26885, 391, 563, 5125, 28840, 337, 257, 1465, 11, 51815], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09358063237420444, "compression_ratio": 1.6653386454183268, "no_speech_prob": 0.004674032796174288}, {"id": 90, "seek": 29514, "start": 295.14, "end": 300.14, "text": " but no sign will be given to it except the sign of the prophet Jonah.", "tokens": [50365, 457, 572, 1465, 486, 312, 2212, 281, 309, 3993, 264, 1465, 295, 264, 18566, 42353, 13, 50615], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05794399639345565, "compression_ratio": 1.791304347826087, "no_speech_prob": 0.0021141446195542812}, {"id": 91, "seek": 29514, "start": 300.14, "end": 305.14, "text": " For just as Jonah was three days and three nights in the belly of the great fish,", "tokens": [50615, 1171, 445, 382, 42353, 390, 1045, 1708, 293, 1045, 13249, 294, 264, 11696, 295, 264, 869, 3506, 11, 50865], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05794399639345565, "compression_ratio": 1.791304347826087, "no_speech_prob": 0.0021141446195542812}, {"id": 92, "seek": 29514, "start": 305.14, "end": 311.14, "text": " so will the Son of Man be three days and three nights in the heart of the earth.", "tokens": [50865, 370, 486, 264, 5185, 295, 2458, 312, 1045, 1708, 293, 1045, 13249, 294, 264, 1917, 295, 264, 4120, 13, 51165], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05794399639345565, "compression_ratio": 1.791304347826087, "no_speech_prob": 0.0021141446195542812}, {"id": 93, "seek": 29514, "start": 311.14, "end": 316.14, "text": " The men of Nineveh will rise up at the judgment with this generation and condemn it,", "tokens": [51165, 440, 1706, 295, 18939, 303, 71, 486, 6272, 493, 412, 264, 12216, 365, 341, 5125, 293, 30733, 309, 11, 51415], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05794399639345565, "compression_ratio": 1.791304347826087, "no_speech_prob": 0.0021141446195542812}, {"id": 94, "seek": 29514, "start": 316.14, "end": 319.14, "text": " for they repented at the preaching of Jonah.", "tokens": [51415, 337, 436, 1085, 6003, 412, 264, 25381, 295, 42353, 13, 51565], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05794399639345565, "compression_ratio": 1.791304347826087, "no_speech_prob": 0.0021141446195542812}, {"id": 95, "seek": 29514, "start": 319.14, "end": 323.14, "text": " And behold, something greater than Jonah is here.", "tokens": [51565, 400, 27234, 11, 746, 5044, 813, 42353, 307, 510, 13, 51765], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05794399639345565, "compression_ratio": 1.791304347826087, "no_speech_prob": 0.0021141446195542812}, {"id": 96, "seek": 32314, "start": 323.14, "end": 328.14, "text": " The queen of the south will rise up at the judgment with this generation and condemn it,", "tokens": [50365, 440, 12206, 295, 264, 7377, 486, 6272, 493, 412, 264, 12216, 365, 341, 5125, 293, 30733, 309, 11, 50615], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05408488719835194, "compression_ratio": 1.6224899598393574, "no_speech_prob": 0.003349065547809005}, {"id": 97, "seek": 32314, "start": 328.14, "end": 333.14, "text": " for she came from the ends of the earth to hear the wisdom of Solomon.", "tokens": [50615, 337, 750, 1361, 490, 264, 5314, 295, 264, 4120, 281, 1568, 264, 10712, 295, 32209, 13, 50865], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05408488719835194, "compression_ratio": 1.6224899598393574, "no_speech_prob": 0.003349065547809005}, {"id": 98, "seek": 32314, "start": 333.14, "end": 337.14, "text": " And behold, something greater than Solomon is here.", "tokens": [50865, 400, 27234, 11, 746, 5044, 813, 32209, 307, 510, 13, 51065], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05408488719835194, "compression_ratio": 1.6224899598393574, "no_speech_prob": 0.003349065547809005}, {"id": 99, "seek": 32314, "start": 337.14, "end": 341.14, "text": " When the unclean spirit has gone out of a person,", "tokens": [51065, 1133, 264, 9153, 282, 3797, 575, 2780, 484, 295, 257, 954, 11, 51265], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05408488719835194, "compression_ratio": 1.6224899598393574, "no_speech_prob": 0.003349065547809005}, {"id": 100, "seek": 32314, "start": 341.14, "end": 344.14, "text": " it passes through waterless places seeking rest,", "tokens": [51265, 309, 11335, 807, 1281, 1832, 3190, 11670, 1472, 11, 51415], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05408488719835194, "compression_ratio": 1.6224899598393574, "no_speech_prob": 0.003349065547809005}, {"id": 101, "seek": 32314, "start": 344.14, "end": 346.14, "text": " but finds none.", "tokens": [51415, 457, 10704, 6022, 13, 51515], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05408488719835194, "compression_ratio": 1.6224899598393574, "no_speech_prob": 0.003349065547809005}, {"id": 102, "seek": 32314, "start": 346.14, "end": 347.14, "text": " Then it says,", "tokens": [51515, 1396, 309, 1619, 11, 51565], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05408488719835194, "compression_ratio": 1.6224899598393574, "no_speech_prob": 0.003349065547809005}, {"id": 103, "seek": 32314, "start": 347.14, "end": 351.14, "text": " I will return to my house from which I came.", "tokens": [51565, 286, 486, 2736, 281, 452, 1782, 490, 597, 286, 1361, 13, 51765], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05408488719835194, "compression_ratio": 1.6224899598393574, "no_speech_prob": 0.003349065547809005}, {"id": 104, "seek": 32314, "start": 351.14, "end": 352.14, "text": " And when it comes,", "tokens": [51765, 400, 562, 309, 1487, 11, 51815], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05408488719835194, "compression_ratio": 1.6224899598393574, "no_speech_prob": 0.003349065547809005}, {"id": 105, "seek": 35214, "start": 352.14, "end": 355.14, "text": " it finds the house empty, swept, and put in order.", "tokens": [50365, 309, 10704, 264, 1782, 6707, 11, 31791, 11, 293, 829, 294, 1668, 13, 50515], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06316832629117099, "compression_ratio": 1.689516129032258, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008758325711824}, {"id": 106, "seek": 35214, "start": 355.14, "end": 361.14, "text": " Then it goes and brings with it seven other spirits more evil than itself,", "tokens": [50515, 1396, 309, 1709, 293, 5607, 365, 309, 3407, 661, 16388, 544, 6724, 813, 2564, 11, 50815], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06316832629117099, "compression_ratio": 1.689516129032258, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008758325711824}, {"id": 107, "seek": 35214, "start": 361.14, "end": 363.14, "text": " and they enter and dwell there.", "tokens": [50815, 293, 436, 3242, 293, 24355, 456, 13, 50915], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06316832629117099, "compression_ratio": 1.689516129032258, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008758325711824}, {"id": 108, "seek": 35214, "start": 363.14, "end": 367.14, "text": " And the last state of that person is worse than the first.", "tokens": [50915, 400, 264, 1036, 1785, 295, 300, 954, 307, 5324, 813, 264, 700, 13, 51115], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06316832629117099, "compression_ratio": 1.689516129032258, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008758325711824}, {"id": 109, "seek": 35214, "start": 367.14, "end": 372.14, "text": " So also will it be with this evil generation.", "tokens": [51115, 407, 611, 486, 309, 312, 365, 341, 6724, 5125, 13, 51365], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06316832629117099, "compression_ratio": 1.689516129032258, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008758325711824}, {"id": 110, "seek": 35214, "start": 372.14, "end": 374.14, "text": " While he was still speaking to the people,", "tokens": [51365, 3987, 415, 390, 920, 4124, 281, 264, 561, 11, 51465], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06316832629117099, "compression_ratio": 1.689516129032258, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008758325711824}, {"id": 111, "seek": 35214, "start": 374.14, "end": 379.14, "text": " behold, his mother and his brothers stood outside asking to speak to him.", "tokens": [51465, 27234, 11, 702, 2895, 293, 702, 8452, 9371, 2380, 3365, 281, 1710, 281, 796, 13, 51715], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06316832629117099, "compression_ratio": 1.689516129032258, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008758325711824}, {"id": 112, "seek": 35214, "start": 379.14, "end": 381.14, "text": " But he replied to the man who told him,", "tokens": [51715, 583, 415, 20345, 281, 264, 587, 567, 1907, 796, 11, 51815], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06316832629117099, "compression_ratio": 1.689516129032258, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008758325711824}, {"id": 113, "seek": 38114, "start": 381.14, "end": 384.14, "text": " Who is my mother, and who are my brothers?", "tokens": [50365, 2102, 307, 452, 2895, 11, 293, 567, 366, 452, 8452, 30, 50515], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10099337100982667, "compression_ratio": 1.5704225352112675, "no_speech_prob": 0.008111589588224888}, {"id": 114, "seek": 38114, "start": 384.14, "end": 388.14, "text": " And stretching out his hand toward his disciples, he said,", "tokens": [50515, 400, 19632, 484, 702, 1011, 7361, 702, 17209, 11, 415, 848, 11, 50715], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10099337100982667, "compression_ratio": 1.5704225352112675, "no_speech_prob": 0.008111589588224888}, {"id": 115, "seek": 38114, "start": 388.14, "end": 391.14, "text": " Here are my mother and my brothers,", "tokens": [50715, 1692, 366, 452, 2895, 293, 452, 8452, 11, 50865], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10099337100982667, "compression_ratio": 1.5704225352112675, "no_speech_prob": 0.008111589588224888}, {"id": 116, "seek": 38114, "start": 391.14, "end": 394.14, "text": " for whoever does the will of my Father in heaven", "tokens": [50865, 337, 11387, 775, 264, 486, 295, 452, 7085, 294, 7162, 51015], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10099337100982667, "compression_ratio": 1.5704225352112675, "no_speech_prob": 0.008111589588224888}, {"id": 117, "seek": 38114, "start": 394.14, "end": 398.14, "text": " is my brother and sister and mother.", "tokens": [51015, 307, 452, 3708, 293, 4892, 293, 2895, 13, 51215], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10099337100982667, "compression_ratio": 1.5704225352112675, "no_speech_prob": 0.008111589588224888}], "language": "English"}